  "remarks": "LIBBS LLC is a front company for JSC IEMZ Kupol, a subsidiary of Russian state-owned arms company Almaz-Antey. It has acted as an intermediary between Kupol and Chinese suppliers manufacturing long-range attack drones of the type Garpiya-A1, which are developed and produced for use in Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine. Therefore, LIBBS LCC is materially supporting Russia’s military and industrial complex.",
